@token = 请先调用 http/users.http 的登录接口，把返回的 data.token 粘贴到此处

### 课程列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 课程列表（推荐课程 + 分类筛选）
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses?category_id=1&is_recommended=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 课程列表（关键词搜索）
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses?keyword=Node
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 课程详情（含分类与用户信息）
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 创建课程
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category_id": 1,
  "user_id": 1,
  "name": "TypeScript 类型体操实战",
  "image": "https://picsum.photos/seed/course-ts/640/360",
  "is_recommended": false,
  "content": "从基础类型到条件类型、映射类型，玩转 TypeScript 类型系统。",
  "like_count": 0,
  "chapter_count": 16
}

### 更新课程（仅传需要修改的字段）
PUT {{baseUrl}}/courses/5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "is_recommended": true,
  "like_count": 60
}

### 删除课程
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/courses/5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
